  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementing Agenda 2030: Increasing the impact of Commonwealth Organisations 2017-2019</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Responsibility for this programme transferred to the cross-HMG Commonwealth Unit, based in the FCO, on 1 January 2019. See: Commonwealth Secretariat (GB-GOV-3-PIN-IOD-CST-001); Commonwealth Foundation (GB-GOV-3-PIN-IOD-CCT-001); Commonwealth of Learning (GB-GOV-3-PIN-IOD-CFL-001).   To strengthen the intergovernmental organisations of the Commonwealth system (the Commonwealth Secretariat, Commonwealth Foundation and the Commonwealth of Learning) to enable them to  provide well targeted and effective support that helps member countries progress towards the Global Goals of Agenda 2030 for Sustainable Development and complements the UK&#x2019;s work to strengthen global peace, security and governance and to strengthen resilience and create economic opportunity in developing countries.</narrative>
  </description>
